# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day19

## Question

Tell me about a time when you had a problem while traveling or going somewhere.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- When it happened
- Where you were going
- What the problem was
- What you did
- How the problem was solved
- How you felt afterward

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> The problem was that...

Also try to use:

> Fortunately,...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

The problem was that...

↓

So I decided to...

↓

Fortunately,...

↓

In the end,...

↓

I felt...
